WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
Control selected dependencies while
retaining real integration checks.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.080
A reviewed payment test runs against
a pinned service and an owned

00:00:08.124 --> 00:00:11.680
provider model that can reproduce
timeouts or duplicate callbacks.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:17.360
A separate gate checks compatibility
with the real provider and batch process.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.840
Refresh the substitute
when its contract changes.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.680
AI may help draft a mapping,
but it does not establish the model's

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.440
fidelity or replace its accountable owner.
